WEBVTT

00:03.050 --> 00:05.800
Skye, look! The water is glowing!

00:11.500 --> 00:12.500
Mila!

00:30.400 --> 00:32.800
Where... am I?

00:38.700 --> 00:41.700
My friend. Yellow jacket. Where is she?

00:41.910 --> 00:48.040
She is safe. Visitors cannot enter this wing. Unregistered visitors are held,

00:48.040 --> 00:50.510
and their memory of this place is sealed.

01:03.410 --> 01:04.510
She is with me.

01:04.960 --> 01:06.560
My future bride.
